<h2>2. Mandatory Quality & Installation Checklist (अनिवार्य नियम)</h2>
<div class="checklist-item">
  <strong>1. DCR Serial Number Mandate:</strong> Solar panels strictly Made-in-India DCR hone chahiye. Dispatch se pehle serial numbers PM Surya Ghar portal par verify honge.
</div>
<div class="checklist-item">
  <strong>2. Structure Material & SS Fasteners:</strong> Structure hot-dip galvanized (80-100 micron) hona chahiye. Sabhi nuts, bolts aur washers strictly <strong>SS 304 grade</strong> ke hone chahiye (MS ya normal GI bolts prohibited hain).
</div>
<div class="checklist-item">
  <strong>3. No Mixed Earthing (आइसोलेटेड अर्थिंग):</strong> Lightning Arrestor (LA) ki line bilkul alag pit mein jayegi. Ise galti se bhi structure ya inverter earthing ke sath common/loop nahi kiya jayega.
</div>
<div class="checklist-item">
  <strong>4. Wire Laying Standard (तारों की सुरक्षा):</strong> Chhat par koi bhi DC wire khula ya latakta hua nahi chhootega; saare wires heavy UV-rated conduit pipe mein saddles ke sath clamped honge.
</div>
<div class="checklist-item">
  <strong>5. Roof Waterproofing:</strong> Chhat par jahan bhi anchor holes honge, wahan civil grout ke sath Dr. Fixit ya bitumen coating se complete leak-proof waterproofing ki jayegi.
</div>

